    generic_method_return_subst_2026_11_09, 0, filed: sibling of PR #7991 (field-read substitution). b.poll() on b: Box<text?> where poll returns Poll<T> fails 'generic enum pattern requires its declared subject owner' (direct ctor, param, factory receivers). Root cause: generic-owner method symbols are registered untyped, so no return type reached match-subject typing. Repro spec RED 0/3.
    generic_method_return_subst_2026_11_09, 1, fix: branch work/generic-method-return-subst (commit c9294577eff). Prescan generic impl method return annotations (module_callable_types prescan_generic_class_method_returns) and substitute receiver type args at the call site via substitute_declared_pattern_type (expression_core instantiated_method_call_return_kind). Spec GREEN 3/3; 9 related generic/pattern specs unchanged (generic_self_method_result_ctor 5/6 pre-existing on base). Awaiting native verification.

